[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22141.51, "timestamp": "06:09:01", "text": "就像一对，比如一个在……之后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22145.19, "timestamp": "06:09:05", "text": "其他的，呃，然后感觉更糟了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22147.27, "timestamp": "06:09:07", "text": "你知道，做个午餐带过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22149.43, "timestamp": "06:09:09", "text": "然后你甚至连吃饭的时间都没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22152.31, "timestamp": "06:09:12", "text": "等你回到家的时候，它就已经在那里了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22155.67, "timestamp": "06:09:15", "text": "呃，有时候它会变质，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22160.07, "timestamp": "06:09:20", "text": "一整天都会非常热。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22162.628, "timestamp": "06:09:22", "text": "所以，我算是中途停了下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22165.27, "timestamp": "06:09:25", "text": "我喜欢做饭，但最近我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22167.11, "timestamp": "06:09:27", "text": "又开始动手做东西了。所以，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22170.07, "timestamp": "06:09:30", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22171.91, "timestamp": "06:09:31", "text": "那很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22178.788, "timestamp": "06:09:38", "text": "自己做饭真是一件美好的事。制作饼干"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22182.628, "timestamp": "06:09:42", "text": "总有一天会实现的。哦，饼干。等等，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22185.19, "timestamp": "06:09:45", "text": "你擅长做中等或中等难度的菜肴吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22188.15, "timestamp": "06:09:48", "text": "比如像鱼之类的重物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22191.35, "timestamp": "06:09:51", "text": "咖喱或者鸡肉之类的东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22194.15, "timestamp": "06:09:54", "text": "是的，我也会做。哇，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22195.99, "timestamp": "06:09:55", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22199.03, "timestamp": "06:09:59", "text": "我还没尝过羊肉呢。"}]